    "body": "I'm trying to style the `<select>` as `display: inline-block`, but I don't know how to manage the case `<button>` is not used:\n```css\nselect {\n  appearance: base-select;\n  display: inline-block;\n  &::picker-icon {\n    display: initial;\n  }\n}\n```\n(the last one)\n<img width=\"306\" height=\"116\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db9cdd79-101a-4adc-8a6d-3072545f6f15\" />\nhttps://codepen.io/sb3nder/pen/LExNqbM\n\n",
